'''''Ruscus hypophyllum''''' is a species of shrub in the family [[Asparagaceae]]. They have a self-supporting growth form. Individuals can grow to 0.42 m.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Ruscus hypophyllum L. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/1082041|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Ruscus hypophyllum (Greater Butcher's Broom) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/ASPG/Ruscus_hypophyllum.php |access-date=2022-03-07 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref>

